Bump to 1.0.1 so the artwork can actually be uploaded

Fabric rejects an upload whose version already exists, so shipping the
new Hub artwork under 1.0.0 would have failed for a reason unrelated to
anything in the package. The version lives in three files that the
preflight cross-checks; all three move together.

